The Lost Cosmos handheld pane loads EmulatorJS 4.2.3, which is GNU GPL-3.0,
from arcade/third_party/emulatorjs inside a separate iframe. Those files stay
unmodified and are not linked into the Apache-2.0 engine. The homebrew ROM
header produced by build_rom_v5.py embeds the Nintendo logo bitmap that Game
Boy Advance hardware checks at boot. No Nintendo BIOS and no commercial ROM
are included.
